  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`CallerWriteAuthorization.cs` exists and holds `CheckCallerMayCreateAsync`, the AppendTo checks, pair resolution, rights evaluation and WhoAmI; none of those members remains in `OwnedChildWrite.cs` (grep proves it) and no forwarding shim was left.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`SecureChildOwnershipAiToolTests*`, `RefileWriterAfterRefileGuardTests` and `RouteAuthorizationGuardTests` pass with no edited assertion; the baseline and final pass counts are recorded and equal.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: a `git diff --color-moved` review shows moved bodies differ from the originals only by namespace/qualifier lines; no log message template, status mapping or check order changed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`RefileAsync` and the create orchestration remain in OwnedChildWrite; no DI registration or interface was added; the new type is `internal static`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">BFF build 0 errors; full BFF unit tests pass; the PR description cites ADR-008 path A; publish-size delta and CVE result are recorded in the task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

